  "question": {
    "text": "A subset of <math><mn>5</mn></math> elements is chosen from the set of first <math><mn>15</mn></math> natural numbers. The probability that at least two of the five numbers are consecutive is <math><mi>λ</mi></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>22</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> is equal to"
  },
